# Local overrides for `pnpm dev` / `wrangler dev`. Copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored).
# Suvakta needs NO API keys: AI and speech use the Workers AI binding, and the
# database/files use D1/R2 bindings configured in wrangler.jsonc.

# Optional — password-reset emails via Cloudflare Email Service. Requires a domain
# onboarded to Email Sending AND a `send_email` binding named EMAIL (see DEPLOYMENT.md).
# EMAIL_FROM=no-reply@yourdomain.in

# Optional — feature flags (true/false). Businesses can further switch them off in Settings.
# FLAG_VOICE_ENABLED=true
# FLAG_AI_INSIGHTS_ENABLED=true
# FLAG_OFFLINE_ENABLED=true
# FLAG_GST_ENABLED=true
# FLAG_REPORTS_ENABLED=true
